# The packaged Cuttlefish APEXes declare IPowerStats/Memtrack but have no lazy-start
# interface line. SystemServer requests it before the boot class_start hal.
# Start the existing read-only reporting services after APEX configs are parsed,
# in the current post-fs-data event, before the queued zygote-start event.
on post-fs-data
    start vendor.power.stats-default
    # Stock memtrack has an interface line for early discovery. The packaged
    # AIDL example lacks it; SystemServer.startMemtrackProxyService waits here.
    start vendor.memtrack-default
